  "instructions": [
    "Use dark, robust maple syrup and add sriracha to taste.",
    "Froth all ingredients except seltzer with a milk frother, or dry shake, then shake with ice to build a creamy head.",
    "Strain into a chilled collins glass without ice and refrigerate briefly to set the foam.",
    "Poke a hole in the center of the foam and slowly top with seltzer.",
    "Optionally serve the reserved egg yolk in a separate shot glass with a pinch of sea salt and a dab of sriracha as a prairie oyster."
